  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/63/15"/><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh/1"/>Look down from the heavens and see,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh/2"/>from the abode of Your holiness and glory.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh/3"/>Where is Your vengeance and Your might?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh/4"/>The multitude of Your compassion and mercy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh/5"/>has been withheld from us.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh/6"/>You split the sea with Your strength;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh/7"/>You shattered the heads of sea monsters
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh/8"/>upon the waters.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh/9"/>If our iniquities testify against us,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:habbet_mishamayim_ureeh/10"/>Adonoy, act [mercifully] for Your Name’s sake.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
